    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 15a6e9b84c7cd5501a3e5fb386ef8aa9548e53cb -->\n**Verdict: needs rework - two items, then this is ready.**\n\nBuilt or not built: read-only review. The author is not a collaborator, so\nthe self-hosted test runner refuses this code by rule, and no local build\nwas authorized. The change is small and the test list is credible.\n\nWhat is good:\n- Plain-English labels, one per control; state words (\"on\", \"off\") in the\n  tooltips. The tooltip suppression during a drag is right.\n- The AccessKit registration (`widget_info`) gives a screen reader the\n  name. The `Hash` derive for the per-button id is the correct way.\n- The two new tests pin every label, the toggle words and the hover\n  behaviour. The provenance line is correct.\n\nItems to fix:\n1. `crates/ui/src/egui_app/viewport_bar.rs` is now 404 lines. The project\n   keeps source files at about 400 lines and splits along the domain seam,\n   and this file already uses that pattern (`viewport_bar_glyphs.rs`,\n   `viewport_bar_controls.rs` are attached with `#[path]`). Please move\n   `label()` and `tooltip()` to a sibling file the same way, for example\n   `viewport_bar_text.rs`.\n2. A UI change needs before and after screenshots in the PR body (project\n   rule for UI PRs). Please add one picture per state with a tooltip\n   showing, and the toggle states it names.\n\nNotes:\n- The head is a refresh merge of `main`; the code half is what was read.\n- Issue #2914 will be moved to `in-review` - only collaborators can set\n  labels, this is noted for the maintainer.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
