    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 7fc28eb9a104b0a9fcdc6d2cb85c517381166970 -->\nReview at head 7fc28eb9a. Read, not built: the PR is from a fork, so its code does not run on the maintainer's runners, and no local build slot was free.\n\nThe two earlier findings:\n1. The 400-line file: met for `viewport_bar.rs`. It is now 277 lines, with the label and tooltip text in a new `viewport_bar_text.rs` (174 lines) - the same `#[path]` sibling pattern the directory already uses.\n2. Before/after screenshots: met. The body carries image links, and the personal path (`C:\\Users\\johns\\...`) is gone: the generator test is now opt-in through `CAMCRAFT_EVIDENCE_SCREENSHOTS_OUT` and `#[ignore]`d with that reason. That is the right form for an evidence generator; it is not a golden and the diff touches no PNG.\nThe new commit `7fc28eb9a` adds the Display button and the display-mode tooltip texts, in step with main's `Nav::Display` (#2818). The texts read correctly.\n\nOne requested change:\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/viewport_bar_tests.rs` is now 511 lines (281 on main; the PR adds 274). AGENTS.md \"400-line files\" applies. Split the PR's new test modules into a `#[path]` sibling, for example `viewport_bar_tooltip_tests.rs`.\n\nGitHub reports the PR CONFLICTING with main again; that is settled at merge time, and the `conflicts` label is added beside `needs-rework` for now.\n",
